      "writtenOn": "2014-06-02T22:53:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I get the original bug and the solution provided here fixes that issue. \n\nJust curious why the cached value is not updated (via refresh) instead of being invalidated. I see in create project, the logic is to set the value if cache is enabled, so possibly value can be updated similarly in cache.\n\nSimilar behavior is there for update_domain.",
      "revId": "c4b5d396365b02f7abe62c95a01ed90fc94674f2",
